onagem com visual de piloto.\n\nComandos:\n/cap1 até /cap23\n/rh — remover capacete\n\n🎮 CONTROLES\n\nEmpinar (Grau) — T (a moto precisa estar em movimento)\n\n🚀 Treine suas manobras, empine motos e domine as ruas no Rodograu!","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bf22d0cc419889514a4e223582e8f0d4/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6bbf0d1220b6d404000710cc7d9354c7/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30b18c10bed69c913cb5c9a800a708da/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}